[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_STARLIGHT_RADIO]
Starlight Radio

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_STARLIGHT_RADIO_desc]
Starlight Radio is a joint development product of the National Security Department and the Science Research Department, with functions such as external propaganda, diplomatic liaison, and military communication.

Blessed by the magic engineering, Starlight Radio’s frequency band cannot be received by ordinary radios, while it can interfere and intercept the frequency bands of other radios. Its security is unparalleled, making it an important channel for external interference.

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_STARLIGHT_RADIO]
星光电台

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_STARLIGHT_RADIO_desc]
星光电台由国家安全部，科学研究部联合研发，具有对外宣传，外交联络及军事通信等功能。

在魔法学工程的加持下，星光电台的频段无法用一般的电台接收，同时能干扰及拦截其他电台的频段，其安全性无可比拟，是对外干涉的重要渠道。
